Implement a 4-to-4 binary decoder that maps each 4-bit input value (sw) to a corresponding 4-bit output value (led). For each combination of the input, the output will be set to a distinct value, incrementing sequentially from 1 to 15 (4'b0001 to 4'b1111) and wrapping around to 4'b0000 for any input outside the defined range (including the input of 4'b1111). The design is intended to create a simple representation of input values through unique output patterns, suitable for driving visual indicators or other applications where such decoding is beneficial.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] sw,
    output reg [3:0] led
);

